%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 15. DuringClash
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: When two Actions Clash during combat, they take place at the <i>Speed</i>
      of the faster one.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1411cc1e1231574797f223a58264863, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Both Actions roll their <i>Power</i> at the same time.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a599acaa6560c5142b54811e60ff9e4e, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Whoever rolls higher wins the exchange, dealing their full Power to
      the loser.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a599acaa6560c5142b54811e60ff9e4e, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: "The loser\u2019s attack is <i>staggered</i>, dealing nothing in return.
      It may even fail to trigger its abilities."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a599acaa6560c5142b54811e60ff9e4e, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: 'I can see how likely I''ll win depending on the colour of the Clash
      icon. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: -8086993822859997525, guid: a30c9c37aff832d4e9ffc5f0c7949d7b, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Gold means I have a great chance of winning, purple means I won't.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5336a0c0d48eafd48914b09050d2a66c, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: Now take this!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxName: 
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 537908265661f2b44970c526d7724cfb, type: 3}
    events: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
